    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "Pnum9",
      "x": 6260,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Design Changes",
      "width": 1800,
      "fill": "#FFFDF8",
      "cornerRadius": 20,
      "stroke": {
        "align": "inside",
        "thickness": 1,
        "fill": "#D3C8B7"
      },
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Sb1IH",
          "name": "logTitle",
          "fill": "#171310",
          "content": "Design Changes",
          "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "y3kvD",
          "name": "logSub",
          "fill": "#6B6257",
          "content": "Bold concept pass applied across all eight top-level portfolio screens.",
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "jgVXv",
          "name": "sharedChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HETRQ",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "1. Shared Visual System\nShifted the light and dark variables into an ivory-and-charcoal trading desk palette, deepened the sidebar and shell chrome, strengthened card borders and radii, and pushed larger JetBrains Mono metrics with clearer positive and negative semantic states.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "TXSSJ",
          "name": "dashboardChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "5a8oT",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "2. Portfolio Dashboard\nRebuilt the top section around a dark net-worth hero, stacked the secondary KPI cards into a tighter right column, added a benchmark and top-mover strip under allocation, and tightened the lower editorial briefing cards so the page has one obvious focal story.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "dn45I",
          "name": "holdingsChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Crz8p",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "3. Holdings & Performance\nMade the holdings table the anchor of the page, darkened the lead KPI module, inserted a compact exposure context band above the table, and improved header contrast, row rhythm, and positive-versus-negative readability throughout the holdings grid.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "we8xg",
          "name": "performanceChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "51Q7W",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "4. Performance Analytics\nPromoted the monthly return story with a stronger lead metric, denser contribution and regime context, warmer analytical table styling, and a corrected monthly table layout so the previously clipped NGKFg section now renders cleanly.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "vAUoA",
          "name": "tradeChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "0b9L6",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "5. Trade Analytics\nReplaced the center-stage donut with a trading activity matrix and selected-day detail, compressed the surrounding insight panels so the calendar becomes the hero, and restyled the recent trades table so the previously clipped uOZqW module now fits without overflow.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Xhtof",
          "name": "researchChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "forYN",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "6. Research Hub\nIntroduced a visible research tab rail, converted the flat queue into a workspace of active thesis, watchlist, journal, and archive cards, and strengthened conviction and freshness cues so the page reads like an operating desk instead of a table dump.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "kcH4n",
          "name": "strategyChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "J5tDc",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "7. Strategy Center\nReshaped the main body into a clearer strategy roster, kept allocation and signal concepts as support modules, added a direct builder CTA, and made live, ready, and policy states read more distinctly through color and card hierarchy.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "bCeDA",
          "name": "executionChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "1jvys",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "8. Execution Monitor\nRecentered the screen around an order entry ticket and working blotter pairing, demoted secondary venue analysis to support content, added stronger tab and status treatment, and made the desk interactions feel more live and operator focused.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "wta32",
          "name": "settingsChanges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F5F0E6",
          "cornerRadius": 14,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "padding": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mPKdV",
              "fill": "#171310",
              "content": "9. Settings & Controls\nAdded a visible settings tab rail, replaced the ops-style donut with a settings workspace covering profile, notifications, and data controls, rebuilt the right rail into a security summary, and turned the lower region into explicit appearance, accounts, and tagging modules.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
